# Local-only working data. `.artifacts/` holds the private transcription-eval
# corpus: recorded human speech is biometric data and must never be committed
# (see app/src/test/resources/transcription_eval/README.md). `.hermes/` holds
# local agent plans/config. Both were previously untracked but NOT ignored, so
# a stray `git add -A` could have committed them.
.artifacts/
.hermes/
.DS_Store
